Download and install an officially supported plugin

Usage: rover plugin install [OPTIONS] <NAME@VERSION>

Arguments:
  <NAME@VERSION>
          The plugin to install, as `<NAME>@<VERSION>`, e.g. `supergraph@=2.9.3` or `router@2`

Options:
  -f, --force
          Overwrite any existing binary without prompting for confirmation
      --elv2-license <ELV2_LICENSE_ACCEPTED>
          Accept the terms and conditions of the ELv2 License without prompting for confirmation. Expected value: `accept` [env: APOLLO_ELV2_LICENSE=]
